sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant T as Target workspace
    participant S as Source (REST)
    participant V as Staging Volume
    Op->>T: Run 00_Install_Jobs (deploy jobs, bake config)
    Op->>T: Run "direct end-to-end (DRY RUN)" Job
    activate T
    T->>S: 01 Inventory  (OAuth M2M)
    T->>S: 02 Export  (OAuth M2M)
    T->>V: write bundle + manifest
    T->>T: 04 Import (dry_run=true) - decide, write NOTHING
    deactivate T
    T-->>Op: dry-run reports (import_status_dry_run.xlsx)
    Note over Op,T: Review preflight verdict + intended actions
    Op->>T: Run "direct end-to-end (LIVE)" Job (dry_run=false)
    activate T
    T->>V: read + verify bundle
    T->>T: 04 Import - create/update in dependency order, ACLs last
    deactivate T
    T-->>Op: import reports + manual_actions_import.md
